op returned project_path_gateway_add_dir 2

case edit-invalid-add-data-file-missing
fs file /t/other/.tools/project-path-gateway/.project-path-gateway
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/other
call project_path_gateway_add_dir NEW_DIR new
status 2
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_add_dir: 데이터 파일을 읽을 수 없습니다: /t/other/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.dirs.conf
op returned project_path_gateway_add_dir 2

case edit-invalid-add-data-file-is-directory
fs file /t/other/.tools/project-path-gateway/.project-path-gateway
fs dir /t/other/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.dirs.conf
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/other
call project_path_gateway_add_dir NEW_DIR new
status 2
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_add_dir: 데이터 파일을 읽을 수 없습니다: /t/other/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.dirs.conf
op returned project_path_gateway_add_dir 2

case edit-invalid-add-tool-directory-denied
fs deny /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_add_dir NEW_DIR new
status 2
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_add_dir: 데이터 파일을 읽을 수 없습니다: /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.dirs.conf
op returned project_path_gateway_add_dir 2

# 쓰기 실패 (US4, FR-030~FR-034, SC-005): 데이터 파일은 그대로, 임시 파일은 지운다
case edit-write-fails-add-data-file-is-link
fs file /t/root/real.conf
content DOCS_DIR=docs
fs link /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.dirs.conf ../../real.conf
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_add_dir NEW_DIR new
status 2
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_add_dir: 데이터 파일이 심볼릭 링크라 바꿀 수 없습니다: /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.dirs.conf
op returned project_path_gateway_add_dir 2

case edit-write-fails-add-data-file-readonly
fs readonly /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.dirs.conf
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_add_dir NEW_DIR new
status 2
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_add_dir: 데이터 파일에 쓰기 권한이 없습니다: /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.dirs.conf
