# 기능 005 보호 사례(US1): 경로의 TAB·= 보존, CR과 LF가 함께 있으면 CR을 먼저 보고한다.
case add-path-with-tab-and-equal
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_add_dir TABBED a\tb=c
status 0
op copy-preserve /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.dirs.conf /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.dirs.conf
op write /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.dirs.conf DOCS_DIR=docs\nTABBED=a\tb=c\n
op move /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.dirs.conf /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.dirs.conf
op returned project_path_gateway_add_dir 0

case edit-invalid-add-path-cr-and-lf-reports-carriage-return
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_add_dir NEW_DIR a\r\nb
status 2
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_add_dir: 경로에 CR 문자를 쓸 수 없습니다
op returned project_path_gateway_add_dir 2

# 기능 007 US3: 종류별 등록. 쓰는 파일은 함수 종류의 데이터 파일 하나이고, 키는 두 파일을 합쳐 유일하다 (contracts/library-api.md 4절)
case add-dir-to-empty-files-writes-dirs-only
fs file /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.dirs.conf
fs file /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.files.conf
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_add_dir SRC src
status 0
op copy-preserve /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.dirs.conf /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.dirs.conf
op write /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.dirs.conf SRC=src\n
op move /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.dirs.conf /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.dirs.conf
op returned project_path_gateway_add_dir 0

case add-file-to-empty-files-writes-files-only
fs file /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.dirs.conf
fs file /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.files.conf
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_add_file CONF config/app.json
status 0
op copy-preserve /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.files.conf /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.files.conf
op write /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.files.conf CONF=config/app.json\n
op move /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.files.conf /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.files.conf
op returned project_path_gateway_add_file 0

case add-file-rejects-key-registered-as-dir
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_add_file DOCS_DIR x.txt
status 2
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_add_file: 이미 등록된 키입니다: DOCS_DIR
op returned project_path_gateway_add_file 2

case add-dir-rejects-key-registered-as-file
fs file /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.files.conf
content CONF=config/app.json
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_add_dir CONF conf
status 2
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_add_dir: 이미 등록된 키입니다: CONF
op returned project_path_gateway_add_dir 2

case add-dir-rejects-file-shape-path
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_add_dir NOTE note.md
call project_path_gateway_add_dir GITHUB .github
status 2
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_add_dir: 디렉터리 경로가 파일 모양입니다(확장자가 있거나 .으로 시작): note.md
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_add_dir: 디렉터리 경로가 파일 모양입니다(확장자가 있거나 .으로 시작): .github
op returned project_path_gateway_add_dir 2
op returned project_path_gateway_add_dir 2

case add-file-rejects-dir-shape-path
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_add_file SRC src
call project_path_gateway_add_file CONF app.json/
call project_path_gateway_add_file MAKE Makefile
status 2
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_add_file: 파일 경로가 파일 모양이 아닙니다(이름.확장자 또는 .으로 시작하는 이름, 끝 / 없음): src
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_add_file: 파일 경로가 파일 모양이 아닙니다(이름.확장자 또는 .으로 시작하는 이름, 끝 / 없음): app.json/
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_add_file: 파일 경로가 파일 모양이 아닙니다(이름.확장자 또는 .으로 시작하는 이름, 끝 / 없음): Makefile
op returned project_path_gateway_add_file 2
op returned project_path_gateway_add_file 2
op returned project_path_gateway_add_file 2

case add-file-key-rule-before-kind-rule
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_add_file conf src
status 2
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_add_file: 키 형식이 잘못되었습니다(대문자로 시작, 대문자·숫자·_만 허용): conf
op returned project_path_gateway_add_file 2

case add-file-write-error-names-files-data-file
fs readonly /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.files.conf
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_add_file CONF app.json
status 2
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_add_file: 데이터 파일에 쓰기 권한이 없습니다: /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.files.conf
op returned project_path_gateway_add_file 2

case add-file-dot-name
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_add_file ENV_FILE .env
status 0
op copy-preserve /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.files.conf /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.files.conf
op write /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.files.conf ENV_FILE=.env\n
op move /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.files.conf /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.files.conf
op returned project_path_gateway_add_file 0
